    "Focused solely on experimental studies, excluding other valuable research types like surveys.",
    "Potential for publication bias (file drawer problem) due to selection of peer-reviewed journals, though suspected to be minor given the small field.",
    "The review itself is a narrative synthesis, not a meta-analysis, and thus does not provide pooled effect sizes."
  ],
